codex
The launcher’s PID namespace is the cause: Lean asks for `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, but that path is absent here even though `/proc/self/exe` works. I’m adding a workspace-local runtime shim that only redirects that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean, Lake, the pinned configuration, or any proof source. Then I’ll rerun the required build.
apply patch
